  "title": "California Grilled Pizza",
  "description": "Cook a fresh pizza topped with mushrooms, onion, and marinated artichoke hearts right on the grill in just minutes using a prebaked pizza crust on sheets of foil to keep everything nice and neat. This recipe makes 2 delicious pizzas.",
